            <li><strong>${this._escape(swapTargetName)}</strong>: "${actorNameEscaped} ${this._escape(swapActionWord)} the shift swap with ${this._escape(swapOriginalAssigneeName)}. You clean ${this._escape(swapWeekLabel)}."</li>
